<Policy title="Privacy and measurement" description="Understand which information The MoneyGoal processes, why calculator inputs stay on your device and how aggregate site and affiliate measurement works.">
<h2>Calculator inputs stay on your device</h2><p>Calculator balances, income, spending, debts and assessment answers are processed in your browser. Our event code does not collect input values or send calculation results. We do not request identity documents or operate financial accounts.</p>
<h2>Site and aggregate events</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts the site and may process request information such as IP addresses and technical headers for delivery, security and its site analytics. After you allow optional analytics, our first-party event endpoint records only a permitted event name, page path, market, tool or offer identifier, and placement. It does not store an IP address, user agent, user ID, query string, calculator value or full referring URL in the event dataset. Events are aggregate signals, not unique-person counts, and may include repeat requests.</p><p>Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control signals keep optional analytics off. Aggregate events are retained in Cloudflare Analytics Engine under its retention policy. We do not sell financial inputs.</p>
<h2>Optional Google Analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics loads only after you choose Allow analytics. It measures visits and the same permitted tool and link events, using analytics cookies that can distinguish browsers. Google may process network and device information under its privacy policy. We remove query strings and fragments from the page address we send and use only the referring site’s origin. We do not send financial answers, calculator values, results, user IDs or advertising data. Advertising signals and automatic form and site-search measurement are disabled.</p><p>Your choice is saved on this device for up to 180 days. Use Analytics choices in the footer to reject analytics later; this stops optional events and removes accessible Google Analytics cookies for this site. Rejection does not affect calculators. Google Analytics reports include only visitors who allow measurement and are not a complete audience count.</p>
<h2>Third parties</h2><p>Fonts may be served by Google Fonts. Clearly marked paid links send you to providers or affiliate networks with their own privacy policies, cookies and attribution systems. Page or placement sub-identifiers must not contain personal information. Opening a provider link is not an application on this site.</p>
<h2>Contacting us</h2><p>Reports submitted through GitHub are public and governed by GitHub’s policies. Do not submit private financial information. <a href="/about">Contact and operator information</a>.</p>
</Policy>
